zuslothdb bundles, under src/vendor/slothdb, the SlothDB SQL engine and
the third-party code it carries. They are copied by tools/vendor.R from

  https://github.com/pedrobtz/slothdb (zuslothdb's fork of SlothDB)

at the commit tools/vendor.yaml (installed as vendor.yaml) names: upstream

  https://github.com/SouravRoy-ETL/slothdb
  commit 8180f215847015944c935f56f008d194e2c1494c

and zuslothdb's changes to it, which that file lists. Each component keeps its own licence, whose full
text is in the file named.

